696
00:46:49,072 --> 00:46:53,072
座ってもいれるっぽい。立ち見もできる感じか？
Looks like we can sit too. Can we also watch while standing?

697
00:46:53,072 --> 00:46:54,872
立ち見もできそう。
Looks like watching while standing is possible too.

698
00:46:56,572 --> 00:46:59,072
当たるかな〜？
I wonder if I'll win~?

699
00:46:59,072 --> 00:47:02,072
当たるかな〜？
I wonder if I'll win~?

700
00:47:04,072 --> 00:47:07,572
アーニャ、何買ったの〜？
Anya, what did you buy~?

701
00:47:07,572 --> 00:47:08,872
え〜っと...
Um...

702
00:47:08,872 --> 00:47:11,072
4つ買いました！
I bought four!

703
00:47:11,072 --> 00:47:12,572
4つ〜？
Four~?

704
00:47:13,072 --> 00:47:15,572
見せられない...
I can't show you...

705
00:47:15,572 --> 00:47:18,872
