Yes, I bought the one with high odds!

710
00:47:35,072 --> 00:47:36,872
買っておけばよかった〜！
I should have bought that too~!

711
00:47:37,072 --> 00:47:40,072
いや、5... 5はちょっと低いのかな？
Well, 5... is 5 a bit low?

712
00:47:40,072 --> 00:47:43,072
5だからな、アーニャちゃんは。
Because Anya-chan bought number 5.

713
00:47:43,072 --> 00:47:45,072
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

714
00:47:48,072 --> 00:47:51,072
いけるかな〜。競馬初めてじゃからあんまり分かんないんじゃけど...
I wonder if it'll win~. It's my first time at horse racing, so I don't really know much...

715
00:47:55,072 --> 00:47:58,572
当たらなかったらビリビリ... ハズレはビリビリ！
If I don't win, electrocution... Losing tickets get electrocuted!

716
