718
00:48:05,572 --> 00:48:07,572
アーニャ〜！
Anya~!

719
00:48:07,572 --> 00:48:09,572
アーニャ〜！
Anya~!

720
00:48:10,072 --> 00:48:13,072
3連複も買ってる！お！始まる？
You bought a Trio bet too! Oh! Is it starting?

721
00:48:13,572 --> 00:48:15,572
競馬チャンネル行くか。
Shall we go to the horse racing channel?

722
00:48:16,072 --> 00:48:19,072
ここで見れるのかな？
Can we watch from here?

723
