00:48:23,572 --> 00:48:27,072
座って見た方がいいのか？でも座って見た方がプロっぽくない？
Is it better to sit and watch? But doesn't sitting down look more professional?

725
00:48:27,072 --> 00:48:31,072
座ってさ、望遠鏡を使ってみたらさ... プロっぽくない？
Sitting down and using a spyglass... wouldn't that look professional?

726
