Woah! That's way too extreme!

730
00:48:48,072 --> 00:48:51,572
オッズの高いやつ買ったのじゃ！
I bought the one with high odds!

731
00:48:53,072 --> 00:48:56,572
来た来た！始まった！頑張れ〜！
It's here, it's here! It's starting! Go for it~!

732
00:48:56,572 --> 00:49:00,072
すげぇ！すげぇ！
Awesome! Awesome!

733
00:49:00,072 --> 00:49:03,572
勝手に追いかけてくれるんだ！始まるのじゃ！
The camera automatically tracks them! It's starting!

734
00:49:04,072 --> 00:49:07,572
行けるか？行けるか？
Can it win? Can it win?

735
00:49:08,072 --> 00:49:11,572
勝てるかな〜？勝てるかな〜？
Will it win~? Will it win~?

736
00:49:12,072 --> 00:49:15,572
テンション上がる、これ！すっげぇ！
This gets me so hyped! Awesome!

737
00:49:16,072 --> 00:49:19,572
