[Text: 3rd Place: Shishiro Botan - Points: 527pt]

2542
02:52:05,793 --> 02:52:11,293
3位で527ptなんだ！
3rd place got 527pt!

2543
02:52:11,493 --> 02:52:15,793
すごいんじゃない、なかなか！
Isn't that pretty impressive?!

2544
02:52:16,093 --> 02:52:23,793
