2548
02:52:41,493 --> 02:52:46,293
500超えだ！おめでとう！
Over 500! Congratulations!

2549
02:52:46,493 --> 02:52:52,493
にんじん賞、第1位は誰なんでしょうか！
Who is the 1st place winner of the Carrot Award?!

2550
